{"name": "Luminere: Final Light", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The light is gone.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The Gloom is consuming the world, twisting the land and its inhabitants and corrupting the Source of Magic.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Only one source of light remains: Luminere, an ancient artifact capable of driving back the Gloom. As long as its radiance endures, the survivors still have somewhere to take shelter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Restore Luminere and build a settlement around it, bring life back to dying lands, and prepare your heroes for expeditions beyond the light.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">But to preserve the last refuge and uncover the cause of the catastrophe, you will have to venture into the Gloom again and again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"195\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5131460/extras/323ce950c096b1ca6e8871663c4009cb.avif?t=1794310836\" width=\"780\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"438\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5131460/extras/1d0f745d81c04195d86a9775f5eae784.poster.avif?t=1794310836\" width=\"780\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5131460/extras/1d0f745d81c04195d86a9775f5eae784.webm?t=1794310836\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5131460/extras/1d0f745d81c04195d86a9775f5eae784.mp4?t=1794310836\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Turn the ruins around Luminere into a settlement you can call home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Gather resources, construct and improve buildings, and decide for yourself how your sanctuary will develop. In time, a small patch of land protected by the ancient light will grow into a true settlement amid a dying world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"195\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5131460/extras/69dd7e88029797b50a08f1b0bdceac9a.avif?t=1794310836\" width=\"780\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"438\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5131460/extras/86f4f2f0983b20a587db31d55e7a3c76.poster.avif?t=1794310836\" width=\"780\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5131460/extras/86f4f2f0983b20a587db31d55e7a3c76.webm?t=1794310836\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5131460/extras/86f4f2f0983b20a587db31d55e7a3c76.mp4?t=1794310836\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Beyond Luminere\u2019s light lies the Gloom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Send heroes on expeditions, chart your path across the map, and decide where to go next. Search for resources and artifacts, meet survivors, and gradually learn the origins of the catastrophe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"438\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5131460/extras/ae0bc66632c7125d8749377112d0bb3a.poster.avif?t=1794310836\" width=\"780\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5131460/extras/ae0bc66632c7125d8749377112d0bb3a.webm?t=1794310836\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5131460/extras/ae0bc66632c7125d8749377112d0bb3a.mp4?t=1794310836\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">But not every encounter will end peacefully. Fight the spawn of the Gloom in <strong>turn-based battles</strong>, assemble the right party, combine your heroes\u2019 skills, and adapt your tactics to each enemy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The deeper you venture into the Gloom, the more dangerous its inhabitants become.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"195\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5131460/extras/0111237c7907b4d3621123c296fdebb6.avif?t=1794310836\" width=\"780\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"438\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5131460/extras/b6ddfbd509762bd588b82289f624178f.poster.avif?t=1794310836\" width=\"780\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5131460/extras/b6ddfbd509762bd588b82289f624178f.webm?t=1794310836\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5131460/extras/b6ddfbd509762bd588b82289f624178f.mp4?t=1794310836\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Powerful enemies bound to mysterious Gates lurk in lands consumed by the Gloom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Some encounters will become a challenge even for a well-prepared party. Study your enemies\u2019 skills, find their weaknesses, change your party composition, and return stronger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Defeat extremely powerful monsters to weaken the Gloom one step at a time and open the Gates.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"195\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5131460/extras/a31276ae76d7cf17893fab4428daa3f1.avif?t=1794310836\" width=\"780\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"438\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5131460/extras/6b32fcaa1bf1157f65a4e4a8e7e59b58.poster.avif?t=1794310836\" width=\"780\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5131460/extras/6b32fcaa1bf1157f65a4e4a8e7e59b58.webm?t=1794310836\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5131460/extras/6b32fcaa1bf1157f65a4e4a8e7e59b58.mp4?t=1794310836\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every character has their own story, personality, and set of skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Build your party for the expedition ahead, develop your heroes, and discover skill combinations that will help you overcome the most dangerous enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"438\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5131460/extras/465ca3e5ad37d1c46c185315d9ee8877.poster.avif?t=1794310836\" width=\"780\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5131460/extras/465ca3e5ad37d1c46c185315d9ee8877.webm?t=1794310836\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5131460/extras/465ca3e5ad37d1c46c185315d9ee8877.mp4?t=1794310836\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"195\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5131460/extras/f9832d7bf2c65820a6c1bdbb1ec84902.avif?t=1794310836\" width=\"780\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"438\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5131460/extras/703ba37e8911e346f41d9408d59ed5f7.poster.avif?t=1794310836\" width=\"780\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5131460/extras/703ba37e8911e346f41d9408d59ed5f7.webm?t=1794310836\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5131460/extras/703ba37e8911e346f41d9408d59ed5f7.mp4?t=1794310836\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In Luminere, there is rarely a single right answer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Make choices during your journeys and conversations, decide the fates of the characters you meet, and choose whom to trust. Your actions will change individual stories and, over time, determine the fate of the entire world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Restore Luminere and wield its power against the Gloom\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2026or find the creature that brought the Gloom into this world and decide its fate yourself.</p> </div>", "short_desc": "In a world consumed by the Gloom, a group of survivors finds refuge among abandoned ruins. Assemble parties of heroes, set out on dangerous expeditions, and return with resources and new allies as you gradually transform the ruins into humanity\u2019s last bastion.", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5131460/20b4223221688a30053670caa131bd3ea58e3ab7/header.jpg?t=1794310836", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Turn-Based Combat", "RPG", "Dark Fantasy", "Party-Based RPG", "Turn-Based Tactics", "Choices Matter"], "developers": "FOR-GAMES CR LTD", "publishers": "FOR-GAMES CR LTD", "release_date": "2027", "price": "Coming Soon", "appid": "5131460", "review_type": "Informational", "curator_desc": "10 November 2026 - Request Access", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/5DdnWpfjgKA", "first_seen": 1794265200.0, "review_rank": 3}